# Reference scenario "title-boot": cold boot up to the title screen.
# Format: tools/scenario.py (times in PRESENTED FRAMES, numbered from 1; no game data here).
# Written on GGTP01 with the last build that still emulated the hardware (kept outside this repository's public
# history; cycle clock, RTC 800000000); its reference run is now recorded natively (tools/ab.py record). The checkpoints are placed on
# stable screens (which wait for an input or last several seconds), away from fades. Order of magnitude: 25 frames/s
# in the early menus, 50 afterwards.
name title-boot
description Cold boot: 60/50 Hz prompt, health warning, logos, title screen.
version GGTP01
window 4

input  150 A       # 60/50 Hz prompt: confirm the 50 Hz option (preselected)
input 1050 A       # health and safety warning, which waits for a button press

check  100 prompt-50-60hz
check  250 confirm-50hz
check  800 health-warning
check 1220 publisher-logo
check 1800 title-screen

end 1900
